{"id":"163597d7804b3604","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-projection-function.md","title":"Projection Functions","display":"df-projection-function — Projection Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-projection-function","aliases":["57-df-projection-function"],"display":"df-projection-function — Projection Functions","depends_on":["[[57-df-natural-number]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-projection-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-projection-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-function — Projection Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le i\\le n\">\\(1\\le i\\le n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>；一元投影使用该文件明示的规范打包，故是自然数上的恒等函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n:D_n\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\pi_i^n(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\\coloneqq x_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_i^n:D_n\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\pi_i^n(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\\coloneqq x_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$1\\le i\\le n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n$；一元投影使用该文件明示的规范打包，故是自然数上的恒等函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le i\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^n:D_n\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\pi_i^n(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle))\\coloneqq x_i.","display":true}],"bytes":693,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-successor-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$D_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$ 取 [[57-df-primrec-operator]]。固定 $F=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal F_n$ 作为 [[57-df-function-closure]] 的闭包论域。$m\\ge1$，$g,h,f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\in F$；$f\\in F$。$C_m:F^{m+1}\\to F$ 和 $R:F^2\\to F$ 在下式定义；类型不相容时返回同一个 $Z$。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primr